{"availability":"available","full":"RoshisRai/roshis-portfolio","name":"roshis-portfolio","description":"A personal portfolio built with Next.js, React, Three.js, and GSAP to showcase interactive web applications, 3D visuals, and frontend experiments. Includes a clean layout, global styles, and an initial homepage—ready for adding project demos and case studies.","category":"Design","language":"TypeScript","stars":2,"forks":0,"created":"2026-04-11T06:58:28Z","updated":"2026-08-28T04:25:02Z","branch":"main","homepage":"https://roshis.dev","topics":["gsap","nextjs","portfolio","rag-chatbot","sanity-blog","sanity-posts-rag","supabase-postgres","threejs"],"demo":"https://www.roshis.dev/","color":"#193546","ink":"#a6d6e8","lastCheckedAt":"2026-10-06T05:41:56.898Z","lastAttemptAt":"2026-10-06T05:41:56.898Z","lastAvailableAt":"2026-10-06T05:41:56.898Z","metrics":[{"at":"2026-10-06T05:41:56.898Z","stars":2,"forks":0}],"technologies":["Next.js","Three.js"],"overview":{"kind":"readme","version":1,"paragraphs":["An engineering-forward, highly interactive portfolio architected to showcase both deep systems-level data engineering and sophisticated frontend UX capabilities. This project serves as a live demonstration of modern web technologies, ranging from custom Retrieval-Augmented Generation (RAG) pipelines on the backend to dynamic WebGL renderings and GSAP animations on the frontend."],"features":["Custom RAG Search Pipeline: Built with Supabase, OpenAI, and native PostgreSQL vector capabilities. Markdown knowledge-base files and Sanity blog posts share the same knowledgechunks table and hybridsearch retriever.","Structure-Aware Chunking: Intelligently splits markdown (and Portable Text posts) on heading boundaries and normalizes lists to preserve logical document layout for superior retrieval continuity.","Idempotent Upserts via Content Hashing: Prevents database duplication by generating stable SHA256 hashes of section, title, and content.","Advanced Hybrid Search: PostgreSQL RPC resolving query ranking with both Reciprocal Rank Fusion (RRF) over Semantic representations (HNSW) and Full-Text Search (tsvector/tsquery).","Automated Data Lifecycle: Markdown ingest uses deletestalechunks to remove orphaned KB rows without touching blog/{slug} chunks. Blog ingest cleans up per post."],"sourceUrl":"https://github.com/RoshisRai/roshis-portfolio/blob/main/README.md","fingerprint":"e21a83c099940a574a076f770c1e49ba9bf2e8d2533e67f310cd569ad948ffcb","extractedAt":"2026-10-06T05:41:56.984Z"},"overviewCheckedAt":"2026-10-06T05:41:56.984Z","projectInsights":{"version":1,"whatItDoes":{"text":"An engineering-forward, highly interactive portfolio architected to showcase both deep systems-level data engineering and sophisticated frontend UX capabilities. This project serves as a live demonstration of modern web technologies, ranging from custom Retrieval-Augmented Generation (RAG) pipelines on the backend to dynamic WebGL renderings and GSAP animations on the frontend.","sourceUrl":"https://github.com/RoshisRai/roshis-portfolio/blob/main/README.md"},"audience":[],"requirements":[{"kind":"api_key","status":"required","text":"Create a .env.local file in the root of the project and populate it with the required API keys and credentials:","sourceUrl":"https://github.com/RoshisRai/roshis-portfolio/blob/main/README.md"}],"fingerprint":"e21a83c099940a574a076f770c1e49ba9bf2e8d2533e67f310cd569ad948ffcb","sourceUrl":"https://github.com/RoshisRai/roshis-portfolio/blob/main/README.md","checkedAt":"2026-10-06T05:41:56.985Z"},"overviewRepoUpdated":"2026-08-28T04:25:02Z","readmeSnapshot":{"version":1,"status":"saved","sourceUrl":"https://github.com/RoshisRai/roshis-portfolio/blob/main/README.md","checkedAt":"2026-10-06T05:41:56.985Z","hash":"e21a83c099940a574a076f770c1e49ba9bf2e8d2533e67f310cd569ad948ffcb","originalBytes":14026,"storedBytes":14026,"truncated":false,"searchTerms":["chunks","sanity","knowledge","search","text","content","blog","ingest","vector","create